@host = http://localhost:5228

### Rooms with at least 8 seats and a projector
GET {{host}}/api/rooms?minCapacity=8&equipment=projector
Accept: application/json

### Floors for the filter
GET {{host}}/api/rooms/floors

### Users with their active reservation count
GET {{host}}/api/users

### Booked reservations
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?status=Booked

### Configured booking limits
GET {{host}}/api/reservations/rules

### Create a reservation (breaks R5: room 006 holds 4 people)
# Set the dates to a day within the next 90 days, otherwise R4/R6 are reported first
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 6,
  "organizerId": 7,
  "title": "Too many people",
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-12-01T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 30
}

### Room usage report for the last 30 days
GET {{host}}/api/reports/room-usage
